# ARPD kit root marker. Its presence tells the ARPD tools that this folder is the kit, not a project
# (check_governance.py stops; install.py refuses to create a project inside it, except by converting this
# folder itself with install.py convert). Do not copy it into a project.
#
# It is also the manifest of kit-development material: the top-level paths below are what
#     python arpd/tools/install.py convert .
# removes when a fresh kit clone becomes a research project in place. Everything else is kept:
# arpd/ and .claude/skills/arpd-* are the ARPD payload; anything else belongs to the project.
.arpd-kit
.arpd-kit-files
AGENTS.md
CITATION.cff
CLAUDE.md
DEVELOPING.md
LICENSE
README.md
RELEASE-NOTES.md
.gitattributes
.gitignore
docs/
evaluation/
tests/
